WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.238
Veteran suicide.

00:00:01.238 --> 00:00:05.920
Male veterans die by suicide at 1.4 times the civilian rate.

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:08.670
Female veterans at 1.9 times.

00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:12.022
This elevated risk has persisted for forty-two years.

00:00:12.022 --> 00:00:13.420
The government has known.
